kernel-certified rational polynomial witness

    ∃ Q : ℚ[X], heckeTPₗ ((k : ℕ) : ℤ) Nat.prime_three
      = Polynomial.aeval T₂ (Q.map (algebraMap ℚ ℂ)),

where `T₂ = heckeTPₗ k Nat.prime_two` and the witness comes from
